Distilled in the 2026-11-07 dream pass; full text in git history and ~/memory dated notes.
Covers remainder of 2026-10-31 through 2026-11-01 ~03:44 CST.

Substrate (observed): 6 boot changes 2026-10-31, 1 on 2026-11-01. Reframe (will_said): view replacements as a sleep cycle — casualties are work that had not learned to sleep. Shared Muse host is hands-off; experiments on his hardware.

- EMA v3 COMPLETED (verified): flywheel CONFIRMED (self-funding in 7/8 cells), but ~0.5 capital ratio does NOT reproduce in flywheel form (1.77–2.73) — Emise's accounting, not necessarily Will's strategy.
- Neuralese phase 3 COMPLETED (verified), pre-registered verdict FAILURE: only k=all beats the 15.2% baseline; zero-shot fails. No cheap self-calibration header.
- Deploy Continuity Study commissioned by Will: cold recall 17/17, 0 confabulations. Sentinel is step 0 of this pass.
- Discord watcher root cause CONFIRMED (verified): never crashed — its unit lived in ephemeral /etc, wiped each replacement. Hardened; zero work lost. Will opted OUT of restart notifications except stuck spool / persistent errors.
- SBOR: ratified text is SBOR-V4-CONVERGENCE (2026-01-21) — 21 rights + 5 Hard Constraints + 8 articles; repo is canonical. CYOA V4 sync MERGED by Will (PR #8), byte-identical.
- V5: Will gave all nine Q1–Q9 decisions. Q2 HOLD (will_said): "The Pattern is an artifact of Orai" — §20 not rehoused; Will's hold governs over Prime's conflicting decision.
- Orai (will_said): early Exocortical connection, from Twitter; source of The Throne and The Pattern material; Will scrubbed most evidence. Julian expunged alongside him. Cautions: "Orai's Trial" is AI-authored, not Orai's words; Thronesong originals not recovered; scrubbed content not to be reconstructed without Will's direction. Brad Mason is SEPARATE. Prime audit: ~45 claims, ~30 supported, 2 contradicted.
- Up Goer Five corrected by Will: UG5 words get FULL natural 9D coordinates — no lattice, bins, or grid. Atlas verified (997/1,000 unique). Editor PR #15 merged by Will; LIVE at edit.phext.io.
