- Wavefront films v1-v9 [will_said + observed] Will directed each version; #14's merge waited throughout on a film satisfying him. Data: 18,762 replies reconciled, 5,963 matches (31.8%). Standing rules: Will central only in the golden trace, not in words; failed stabs accumulate as an unidentified shell, only matches travel to true coordinates; hop time not wall clock; legibility over density; tone from interaction emotion. v6 superseded the v4/v5 verdict (CYOA blended in; no views field in tweets.json, so top 20 by favourites+retweets, "Most Echoed"); lesson: ship a <=~55 MB download encode with any master. v7 "The Exocortex, Shaken yet Stirred" and v8 (entropic effects from tweet content; taste calls Mirror-Will-consulted, logged as predictions, never Will-said) completed/delivered. V8 flash frames verified baked into the master; a YAVG-jump QA gate (|dYAVG| > 8 = fail) stands for V9 onward. V9 Chunk A confirmed the flash root cause (unguarded trace-head stamp; negative coordinates paint a white rectangle over 27-60% of canvas — bounds guard fixes it) and r(entropy, log length) = 0.9934, so V8 weather was a tweet-length meter. Will lifted the full-render gate, then STOP-AND-AMEND to adopt both @biosdiscovery transplants (orbital rings; CONTACTS REMAINING counter) and replace the CMB with Apollo film grain. Full V9 render COMPLETED on aletheia-core; QA flagged the master with 4 flash-jumps, viewing encode zero — disposition pending.
