  relocations L7; locks stay real via the shared
  Phase 2 flock-anchor registry, contention
  messages byte-identical. Native envelopes are
  raw-sliced on block boundaries, never
  re-serialised (sample 8,061 B -> 17 slices,
  hash identical after round-trip). Emise
  verified 58/58 across phext + Phase 2 + 3a
  suites; typecheck/build 0; boot smoke HTTP 200
  both modes. Will directed the merge; main is
  now c7a5663 (parents e6d3275 + 057c330, tree
  identical to branch head). Live site unchanged
  until Will redeploys; phextVfs still off.
- ~21:44 [will_said] Phase 4 ordered, ahead of
  3b: "unpack whatever he's using SQLite for —
  unravel that mystery into the phext as well —
  the only thing we keep separate: media files"
  (the media clause was re-examined later this
